{"type":"text","timestamp":1790361313797,"sessionID":"ses_f2629bb21ffe0xvzFay5jseIhh","part":{"id":"prt_0d9d9a1f9001fF8eGt1qQ6YwTb","messageID":"msg_0d9d6f707001rA3RXWBwitY8Vh","sessionID":"ses_f2629bb21ffe0xvzFay5jseIhh","type":"text","text":"The project is a minimal Godot scene: the world already exposes a safe custom-data lookup, while the TileSet has no sources yet. I’ll add the requested metadata and resources directly in the `.tscn` files, then keep the tank logic resilient when a tile has no `tile_type` value.","time":{"start":1790361313785,"end":1790361313787},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_016fd62095b0050b016ab6bea9f44887d0b16d36347d3c08e5","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790361313829,"sessionID":"ses_f2629bb21ffe0xvzFay5jseIhh","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_bYJq17c3JUCMgyhTiiLcVoKg","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/world.tscn\n@@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid=\"uid://world_start_1218\"]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3 uid=\"uid://world_start_1218\"]\n@@\n [sub_resource type=\"TileSet\" id=\"TileSet_world\"]\n+custom_data_layer_0/name = \"tile_type\"\n+custom_data_layer_0/type = 2\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"Gradient\" id=\"Gradient_water\"]\n+colors = PackedColorArray(0.0470588, 0.470588, 0.784314, 1, 0.172549, 0.784314, 0.909804, 1)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"GradientTexture1D\" id=\"GradientTexture1D_water\"]\n+gradient = SubResource(\"Gradient_water\")\n+width = 64\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"Gradient\" id=\"Gradient_dirt\"]\n+colors = PackedColorArray(0.337255, 0.172549, 0.0862745, 1, 0.705882, 0.45098, 0.219608, 1)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"GradientTexture1D\" id=\"GradientTexture1D_dirt\"]\n+gradient = SubResource(\"Gradient_dirt\")\n+width = 64\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"Gradient\" id=\"Gradient_grass\"]\n+colors = PackedColorArray(0.196078, 0.541176, 0.117647, 1, 0.603922, 0.843137, 0.219608, 1)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"GradientTexture1D\" id=\"GradientTexture1D_grass\"]\n+gradient = SubResource(\"Gradient_grass\")\n+width = 64\n \n [node name=\"World\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n script = ExtResource(\"1_world\")\n+water_color = SubResource(\"GradientTexture1D_water\")\n+dirt_color = SubResource(\"GradientTexture1D_dirt\")\n+grass_color = SubResource(\"GradientTexture1D_grass\")\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/world.gd\n@@\n extends Node2D\n class_name World\n \n+enum TILE_TYPES { NONE, WATER, DIRT, GRASS }\n+\n+@export var water_color: GradientTexture1D\n+@export var dirt_color: GradientTexture1D\n+@export var grass_color: GradientTexture1D\n+\n @onready var tile_map: TileMap = $TileMap\n \n static var _instance: World = null\n+var tile_type_gradients: Dictionary = {}\n \n func _ready():\n \tif _instance == null:\n \t\t_instance = self\n+\ttile_type_gradients = {\n+\t\tTILE_TYPES.WATER: water_color,\n+\t\tTILE_TYPES.DIRT: dirt_color,\n+\t\tTILE_TYPES.GRASS: grass_color,\n+\t}\n@@\n static func get_custom_data_at(position: Vector2, custom_data_name: String) -> Variant:\n \tvar data = get_tile_data_at(position)\n \tif data == null:\n \t\treturn null\n \treturn data.get_custom_data(custom_data_name)\n+\n+\n+static func get_gradient_at(position: Vector2) -> GradientTexture1D:\n+\tvar tile_type = get_custom_data_at(position, \"tile_type\")\n+\treturn _instance.tile_type_gradients.get(tile_type)\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\n@@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid=\"uid://tank_start_1218\"]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid=\"uid://tank_start_1218\"]\n@@\n [sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"RectangleShape2D_1\"]\n size = Vector2(26, 26)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"ParticleProcessMaterial\" id=\"ParticleProcessMaterial_left\"]\n+emission_shape = 3\n+emission_box_extents = Vector3(-16, 0, 0)\n+direction = Vector3(0, -16, 0)\n+spread = 25.0\n+gravity = Vector3(0, 0, 0)\n+initial_velocity_max = 4.0\n+damping_max = 3.0\n+scale_min = 0.25\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"ParticleProcessMaterial\" id=\"ParticleProcessMaterial_right\"]\n+emission_shape = 3\n+emission_box_extents = Vector3(-16, 0, 0)\n+direction = Vector3(0, 16, 0)\n+spread = 25.0\n+gravity = Vector3(0, 0, 0)\n+initial_velocity_max = 4.0\n+damping_max = 3.0\n+scale_min = 0.25\n@@\n [node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\n shape = SubResource(\"RectangleShape2D_1\")\n+\n+[node name=\"LeftTrackParticles\" type=\"GPUParticles2D\" parent=\".\"]\n+z_index = -1\n+emitting = false\n+amount = 128\n+process_material = SubResource(\"ParticleProcessMaterial_left\")\n+\n+[node name=\"RightTrackParticles\" type=\"GPUParticles2D\" parent=\".\"]\n+z_index = -1\n+emitting = false\n+amount = 128\n+process_material = SubResource(\"ParticleProcessMaterial_right\")\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/tank.gd\n@@\n var direction := Vector2.RIGHT\n+@onready var left_track_particles: GPUParticles2D = $LeftTrackParticles\n+@onready var right_track_particles: GPUParticles2D = $RightTrackParticles\n+\n+var current_particle_gradient: GradientTexture1D = null\n@@\n \telse:\n \t\tvelocity = Vector2.ZERO\n \tmove_and_slide()\n+\t_update_track_particles()\n+\n+\n+func _update_track_particles() -> void:\n+\tvar particle_gradient := World.get_gradient_at(position)\n+\tif particle_gradient != current_particle_gradient:\n+\t\tcurrent_particle_gradient = particle_gradient\n+\t\tleft_track_particles.process_material.color_ramp = particle_gradient\n+\t\tright_track_particles.process_material.color_ramp = particle_gradient\n+\n+\tvar moving := velocity != Vector2.ZERO\n+\tleft_track_particles.emitting = moving\n+\tright_track_particles.emitting = moving\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scenes/world.tscn\nM workspace/scripts/world.gd\nM workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\nM workspace/scripts/tank.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scenes/world.tscn\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/world.tscn\n+++ /workspace/scenes/world.tscn\n@@ -1,12 +1,38 @@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid=\"uid://world_start_1218\"]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3 uid=\"uid://world_start_1218\"]\n \n [ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scripts/world.gd\" id=\"1_world\"]\n \n [sub_resource type=\"TileSet\" id=\"TileSet_world\"]\n+custom_data_layer_0/name = \"tile_type\"\n+custom_data_layer_0/type = 2\n \n+[sub_resource type=\"Gradient\" id=\"Gradient_water\"]\n+colors = PackedColorArray(0.0470588, 0.470588, 0.784314, 1, 0.172549, 0.784314, 0.909804, 1)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"GradientTexture1D\" id=\"GradientTexture1D_water\"]\n+gradient = SubResource(\"Gradie