{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790361511090,"sessionID":"ses_f2629bb21ffe0xvzFay5jseIhh","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_XjhC3dCxaBG6L4xLZTZWXmJ2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/world.gd\n@@\n \ttile_type_gradients = {\n+\t\tTILE_TYPES.NONE: null,\n \t\tTILE_TYPES.WATER: water_color,\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\n@@\n [sub_resource type=\"ParticleProcessMaterial\" id=\"ParticleProcessMaterial_left\"]\n+resource_local_to_scene = true\n+particle_flag_disable_z = true\n@@\n [sub_resource type=\"ParticleProcessMaterial\" id=\"ParticleProcessMaterial_right\"]\n+resource_local_to_scene = true\n+particle_flag_disable_z = true\n@@\n [node name=\"LeftTrackParticles\" type=\"GPUParticles2D\" parent=\".\"]\n z_index = -1\n+position = Vector2(0, -12)\n@@\n [node name=\"RightTrackParticles\" type=\"GPUParticles2D\" parent=\".\"]\n z_index = -1\n+position = Vector2(0, 12)\n*** Add File: /workspace/verify_particles.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\t_run.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _run() -> void:\n+\tvar scene := Node2D.new()\n+\troot.add_child(scene)\n+\tscene.scale = Vector2(4, 4)\n+\tvar world: World = load(\"res://scenes/world.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\tscene.add_child(world)\n+\tassert(world.tile_map.tile_set.get_custom_data_layer_name(0) == \"tile_type\")\n+\tassert(world.tile_map.tile_set.get_custom_data_layer_type(0) == TYPE_INT)\n+\tvar atlas := TileSetAtlasSource.new()\n+\tatlas.texture = load(\"res://assets/sprites/terrain.png\")\n+\tatlas.texture_region_size = Vector2i(16, 16)\n+\tworld.tile_map.tile_set.add_source(atlas, 0)\n+\tvar tiles := [Vector2i(2, 7), Vector2i(7, 0), Vector2i(2, 4)]\n+\tvar gradients := [world.water_color, world.dirt_color, world.grass_color]\n+\tfor i in range(3):\n+\t\tatlas.create_tile(tiles[i])\n+\t\tatlas.get_tile_data(tiles[i], 0).set_custom_data(\"tile_type\", i + 1)\n+\t\tfor x in range(1, 17):\n+\t\t\tfor y in range(i * 4 + 1, i * 4 + 5):\n+\t\t\t\tworld.tile_map.set_cell(0, Vector2i(x, y), 0, tiles[i])\n+\t\tassert(World.get_gradient_at(Vector2(64, 40 + i * 64)) == gradients[i])\n+\tassert(World.get_gradient_at(Vector2(-32, -32)) == null)\n+\tvar tank: Tank = load(\"res://scenes/tank.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\tscene.add_child(tank)\n+\ttank.get_node(\"BodySprite\").texture = load(\"res://assets/sprites/tank_body.png\")\n+\ttank.set_physics_process(false)\n+\tvar left: GPUParticles2D = tank.get_node(\"LeftTrackParticles\")\n+\tvar right: GPUParticles2D = tank.get_node(\"RightTrackParticles\")\n+\tassert(not left.emitting and not right.emitting)\n+\tfor emitter in [left, right]:\n+\t\tassert(emitter.amount == 128 and emitter.z_index == -1)\n+\t\tvar material: ParticleProcessMaterial = emitter.process_material\n+\t\tassert(material.emission_shape == ParticleProcessMaterial.EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX)\n+\t\tassert(material.emission_box_extents.x == -16)\n+\t\tassert(material.spread == 25 and material.gravity == Vector3.ZERO)\n+\t\tassert(material.initial_velocity_max == 4 and material.damping_max == 3)\n+\t\tassert(material.scale_min == 0.25)\n+\tassert(left.process_material.direction.y == -16)\n+\tassert(right.process_material.direction.y == 16)\n+\tInputMap.add_action(\"move_forward\")\n+\tInputMap.add_action(\"move_backward\")\n+\tfor i in range(3):\n+\t\ttank.position = Vector2(64, 40 + i * 64)\n+\t\tInput.action_press(\"move_forward\")\n+\t\ttank.set_physics_process(true)\n+\t\tfor frame in range(80):\n+\t\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\t\tassert(left.emitting and right.emitting)\n+\t\tassert(left.process_material.color_ramp == gradients[i])\n+\t\tassert(right.process_material.color_ramp == gradients[i])\n+\t\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\t\tassert(root.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://particle_check_%d.png\" % i) == OK)\n+\t\tInput.action_release(\"move_forward\")\n+\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\t\tassert(not left.emitting and not right.emitting)\n+\t\ttank.set_physics_process(false)\n+\tInput.action_press(\"move_backward\")\n+\ttank.set_physics_process(true)\n+\tawait physics_frame\n+\tawait physics_frame\n+\tassert(left.emitting and right.emitting)\n+\tInput.action_release(\"move_backward\")\n+\ttank.set_physics_process(false)\n+\ttank.position = Vector2(-32, -32)\n+\ttank._update_track_particles()\n+\tassert(left.process_material.color_ramp == null)\n+\tassert(right.process_material.color_ramp == null)\n+\tprint(\"PASS: tile metadata, all terrain gradients, particle settings, forward/reverse motion, stopping, and empty-tile transitions\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scripts/world.gd\nM workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\nA workspace/verify_particles.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/world.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/world.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/world.gd\n@@ -15,8 +15,9 @@\n func _ready():\n \tif _instance == null:\n \t\t_instance = self\n \ttile_type_gradients = {\n+\t\tTILE_TYPES.NONE: null,\n \t\tTILE_TYPES.WATER: water_color,\n \t\tTILE_TYPES.DIRT: dirt_color,\n \t\tTILE_TYPES.GRASS: grass_color,\n \t}\n\nIndex: /workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\n+++ /workspace/scenes/tank.tscn\n@@ -5,8 +5,10 @@\n [sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"RectangleShape2D_1\"]\n size = Vector2(26, 26)\n \n [sub_resource type=\"ParticleProcessMaterial\" id=\"ParticleProcessMaterial_left\"]\n+resource_local_to_scene = true\n+particle_flag_disable_z = true\n emission_shape = 3\n emission_box_extents = Vector3(-16, 0, 0)\n direction = Vector3(0, -16, 0)\n spread = 25.0\n@@ -15,8 +17,10 @@\n damping_max = 3.0\n scale_min = 0.25\n \n [sub_resource type=\"ParticleProcessMaterial\" id=\"ParticleProcessMaterial_right\"]\n+resource_local_to_scene = true\n+particle_flag